the_extra_rules:
It acts only between frames:
- the second CLICK lands on a frame where nothing changes for 36 frames;
- the bottle and five glasses arrive while Scott looks down at Deena's foot;
- the phone is taken and returned across the flash;
- Marina vanishes between two identical framings of the doorway;
- cards land at fake-Kay's place across cuts.

motion_rules:
SHAPE MATCH CUTS:
- six glasses into six title bars;
- the wine ring into the coaster, and later into the blood pool;
- the card rectangle into the phone screen, the oven door, the back door, and Angelo's final card;
- the under-door light line into the line of gas haze;
- Angelo's failed spark into the first fire window;
- the title bars into the strobing fence slats.
